Maintainer: edulution.io <info@netzint.de>
Changed-By: Lukas Spitznagel <lukas.spitznagel@netzint.de>
Description:
 edulution-linbo-vdi - VDI service for linuxmuster.net on Proxmox
Changes:
 edulution-linbo-vdi (1.1.2) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * preinst removes a symlink at /usr/lib/python3/dist-packages/edulution_linbo_vdi
     left by manual 1.0.x workarounds, so the upgrade does not install through it.
   * Fix: TLS pinning against pve-root-ca.pem failed on Python 3.13+ (strict
     X.509 mode rejects the CA's missing keyUsage); a pinned CA now verifies the
     chain and hostname without the strict extension check.
   * Fix: the systemd sandbox blocked netlink, so 'net conf list' and
     smbstatus failed inside the service (user detection broken); allow
     AF_NETLINK.
   * The documented Proxmox role no longer lists VM.GuestAgent.Audit, which
     Proxmox VE 8 rejects; PVE 9 users add it themselves.
   * New masters get the QEMU guest agent option enabled (agent=enabled=1,
     overridable per group), so logged-in users are detected without SMB.
